  "description": "**Retro Grunge** is a bold vintage display font designed with authentic distressed textures that create a timeless retro appearance. Every character is crafted to deliver a rugged, weathered look inspired by classic western typography, old advertising posters, industrial signage, and vintage print design.\nWhether you’re creating apparel graphics, logo designs, branding, posters, packaging, labels, stickers, merchandise, or social media content, Retro Grunge adds bold personality and nostalgic charm to any project.\n### Features\n• Uppercase Letters (A–Z)\n• Numbers & Punctuation\n• Multilingual Support\n• PUA Encoded\n• OTF, TTF & WOFF Formats\n• Easy Installation\n• Commercial Use\n### Perfect For\n• Vintage Logos\n• Retro Branding\n• T-Shirt Designs\n• Posters & Flyers\n• Product Packaging\n• Whiskey & Beer Labels\n• Cafe & Restaurant Branding\n• Outdoor Adventure Graphics\n• Stickers & Decals\n• Merchandise\n• Social Media Graphics\n• YouTube Thumbnails\n• Cricut & Silhouette Projects\n• Handmade Crafts\n• Print-on-Demand Products\nBring an authentic vintage character to your creative projects with Retro Grunge—a bold display font built for designers who love classic style with a distressed finish.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>**Retro Grunge** is a bold vintage display font designed with authentic distressed textures that create a timeless retro appearance. Every character is crafted to deliver a rugged, weathered look inspired by classic western typography, old advertising posters, industrial signage, and vintage print design.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating apparel graphics, logo designs, branding, posters, packaging, labels, stickers, merchandise, or social media content, Retro Grunge adds bold personality and nostalgic charm to any project.</p>\n<p>### Features</p>\n<p>• Uppercase Letters (A–Z)<br>\n• Numbers &amp; Punctuation<br>\n• Multilingual Support<br>\n• PUA Encoded<br>\n• OTF, TTF &amp; WOFF Formats<br>\n• Easy Installation<br>\n• Commercial Use</p>\n<p>### Perfect For</p>\n<p>• Vintage Logos<br>\n• Retro Branding<br>\n• T-Shirt Designs<br>\n• Posters &amp; Flyers<br>\n• Product Packaging<br>\n• Whiskey &amp; Beer Labels<br>\n• Cafe &amp; Restaurant Branding<br>\n• Outdoor Adventure Graphics<br>\n• Stickers &amp; Decals<br>\n• Merchandise<br>\n• Social Media Graphics<br>\n• YouTube Thumbnails<br>\n• Cricut &amp; Silhouette Projects<br>\n• Handmade Crafts<br>\n• Print-on-Demand Products</p>\n<p>Bring an authentic vintage character to your creative projects with Retro Grunge—a bold display font built for designers who love classic style with a distressed finish.</p>",
